title Klondike: mid-game, a column of 6 face down and King to Ace (the longest fan), draw 1
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1280x800 480x800 800x1280 480x640
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DATA b-mid
env KLONDIKE_TEST_RESET 1
env KLONDIKE_TEST_BOARD "f - - - -;t AC;t 2c 4C;t 5c 6c 8C;t 9c tc qc KC;t ad 3d 4d 5d 7D;t 8d 9d jd qd kd AH;t 2h 3h 5h 6h 7h 9h KS QH JC TD 9S 8H 7C 6D 5S 4H 3C 2D AS;w;s TH JH KH 2S 3S 4S 6S 7S 8S TS JS QS;r 0"
wait 300
shot mid
check mid
expect text "Moves 0"
